          >
            <div class="zn-element zn-lg  ">
              <div id="" class="zn-text "   ><p>While many of my neighbors have fled their front porches for air conditioning until fall, I didn’t move here to hole-up inside. I’m on a mission to bask in the great outdoors without blistering in the UV. With my freckled, elmer’s-glue skin, that’s a tall order. But that’s also why I moved to the mountains and not back home to flatlands. </p><p><br></p><p>The Appalachians offer endless cool havens for the heat-wary, you just have to go up, go down, or go underground.&nbsp;</p></div>
            </div>
            
            
